        <xpdl2:Activity Id="_m7c4kLnGEemgcbm71HEQ6A" Name="RecuperaAssetRicarica" IsATransaction="false" xpdExt:Visibility="Private" xpdExt:RequireNewTransaction="false" xpdExt:DisplayName="Recupera AssetRicarica">
          <xpdl2:Implementation>
            <xpdl2:Task>
              <xpdl2:TaskScript>
                <xpdl2:Script ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">if(IDAssetRicarica != null)&#xD;
{&#xD;
	var criteria = cac_it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_AssetRicarica.createCriteria(&quot;IDAssetRicarica =: ID&quot;);&#xD;
	criteria.setQueryParameter(&quot;ID&quot;,IDAssetRicarica);&#xD;
&#xD;
	var AssetRicaricaRefs = cac_it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_AssetRicarica.findByCriteria(criteria);&#xD;
	&#xD;
	if(AssetRicaricaRefs.size() == 1)&#xD;
	{&#xD;
		AssetRicaricaRef = AssetRicaricaRefs.get(0);&#xD;
		AssetRicarica = AssetRicaricaRef.readAssetRicarica();&#xD;
		Process.auditLog(&quot;Recuperato Asset Ricarica con ID: &quot;+AssetRicarica.IDAssetRicarica.toString());&#xD;
	}&#xD;
	else&#xD;
	{&#xD;
		Process.auditLog(&quot;Nessuno o più asset trovati con ID &quot;+IDAssetRicarica);&#xD;
	}&#xD;
}</xpdl2:Script>
              </xpdl2:TaskScript>
            </xpdl2:Task>
          </xpdl2:Implementation>
          <xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfos>
            <xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfo BorderColor="0,0,128" FillColor="255,219,74" Height="64.0" LaneId="_GEC3V7m-Eemgcbm71HEQ6A" Width="101.0">
              <xpdl2:Coordinates XCoordinate="413.0" YCoordinate="155.0"/>
            </xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfo>
          </xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfos>
